abstract: >-
  A modular engine for spatial access and allocation models. Floating
  catchment area (FCA) methods and an experimental static conditional logit
  allocation model with an outside option share the same demand, supply and
  travel-time inputs, decay kernels and numeric engine, which reads rasters in
  blocks and works on compact matrices.
keywords:
